        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Parallel Arm Mount Bracket - Pin Mounted</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <a href=\"/products/surface-mounted-ada-compliant-door-closer-global-tc2201ada\"><b>Global TC2201ADA</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/tc201-global-grade-1-surface-mount-door-closer\"><b>Global TC201</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/tc411-ada-compliant-grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer\"><b>Global TC411</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/tc412-grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer\"><b>Global TC412</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-full-cover-tri-packed-door-closer\"><b>Global TC511</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-full-cover-door-closer\"><b>Global TC512</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer-global-tc611\"><b>Global TC611</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer-global-tc612\"><b>Global TC612</b></a>. Used with a regular arm. Can be used with any surface mounted closer where the arm has no shoe and the ball socket is 3/8\" diameter.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n <li>Width at Header Mount: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n <li>Arm Mount Pin Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/8\" Thick Steel</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with wood and machine screws for use on wood or metal door frames. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
